    "text": "DIA\nWork\nAbout\nProcess\nIndex\n[\nSearch\n]\n[\nClose\n]\nDIA:\n Scan Type\n[\nNext\n]\nLoading\nLoading\nLoading\nLoading\nLoading\nLoading\n\nScan Type is one of our most recognized designs, originally released in 2017 as part of our A-Trak stage visuals and widely reproduced and tutorialized since. In 2024 we rebuilt it as a real-time GPU application, applying slit-scan to live text input with adjustable direction, speed, and slice geometry.\n\nCredits:\n\nMitch Paone\nMeg Donohoe\nDaniel Wenzel\n\nYear:\n\n2024\n\n[\nPrivacy Policy\n]\n[\nAccept\n]",
